ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Feng and Wang Li are business rivals, both operating companies in the same field. To break the stalemate, Zhang Feng released a fabricated financial report to make the outside world believe that his company was thriving. Wang Li noticed Zhang Feng's move, and she deliberately had someone announce on social media that she was about to launch a disruptive innovation to get Zhang Feng's attention.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Wang Li announce that she is about to launch a disruptive innovation?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Wang Li hopes Zhang Feng thinks the innovation her company is about to launch poses a major threat to his business.\nB. Wang Li thinks Zhang Feng's move is not worth mentioning.\nC. Wang Li learns that Zhang Feng's company financial report shows his business is in good condition.\nD. Wang Li thinks her company urgently needs an innovation to stay competitive.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035934754481534202,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e312d6006945d2804438","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368274874,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:37:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"03399c07ce72428782c847fe1db0da4f"}